sequenceDiagram
    autonumber off
    actor Steward
    participant Form as New SIR page<br/>new-report/page.tsx
    participant Actions as Server actions<br/>ProfileService, queries.ts
    participant INat as iNaturalist API<br/>api.inaturalist.org
    participant Presign as Presign route<br/>/api/s3/presign
    participant S3 as AWS S3

    Note over Steward,S3: Covers US 4.0.5. All iNaturalist steps are proposed. The browser calls iNaturalist.<br/>The upload steps after "Submit SIR" exist today for photos from the device.

    Steward->>Form: Select Add photos from iNaturalist (proposed)
    Form->>Actions: getStewardProfile(own user id): read inat_username (proposed)
    Actions-->>Form: Profile
    alt Profile has inat_username
        Form->>Form: Use the saved user name
    else No saved user name
        Form-->>Steward: Ask for iNaturalist user name (proposed)
        Steward->>Form: Enter user name
        opt Steward accepts the offer to save it (proposed)
            Form->>Actions: updateOwnProfile(fields with inat_username) (proposed)
        end
    end
    Form->>INat: selectINaturalistPhotos(user name):<br/>GET /v1/observations?user_login=name&photos=true (proposed)
    alt User not found, no photos, or API error
        INat-->>Form: Error or empty list
        Form-->>Steward: Show message. Upload from device still works
    else Observations are found
        INat-->>Form: Observations with photo URLs and taxon names
        Form-->>Steward: Show photos
        Steward->>Form: Select photos (AT 1)
        Form->>Form: Add photos to the SIR. Keep each observation id.<br/>Fill Identifier from the observation taxon name (AT 2)
    end

    Steward->>Form: Submit SIR
    Form->>Actions: addSiteInspectionReport (exists)
    Actions-->>Form: responseId
    loop Each selected iNaturalist photo (copy, not link)
        Form->>INat: GET photo file (proposed)
        INat-->>Form: Image file
        Form->>Presign: POST file name, type, size, responseId,<br/>identifier (exists)
        Presign-->>Form: Presigned PUT URL and key
        Form->>S3: PUT copy of the image (exists)
    end
    Form->>Actions: uploadSiteInspectionAnswers (exists),<br/>insertInspectionAttachments with inat_observation_id<br/>(exists, new column is proposed)
    alt An upload or insert fails
        Form->>Actions: rollbackSiteInspectionSubmission(responseId) (exists)
        Form-->>Steward: Show error. SIR is not saved
    else All steps pass
        Form-->>Steward: Go to /sites?submitted=true
    end

    Note over Steward,S3: Open questions: copy the photo to S3 or link to it (this diagram shows the proposed copy),<br/>iNaturalist OAuth or user name only, the photo licence, and if the photo host lets the browser read the file (CORS).
